# Review routing for PRs into this vault.
#
# Without GitHub Team branch protection this does not *block* a merge -- it
# auto-requests reviewers so PRs get eyes. When Team+ rulesets land, pair it with
# "require review from code owners" and this file starts enforcing.
#
# Paths were rewritten for the restructured layout (2026-09-17). The previous
# entries still pointed at the obsidian-legacy tree -- /knowledge-base/ and
# /playbooks/ were top-level there and matched nothing here, so those two rules
# had been silently dead since the restructure.

# Default: vault maintainers
*                                   @phildonovan

# Shared knowledge and the AI map -- keep discoverability intentional
/_ai/                               @phildonovan

# The guardrails themselves. A change here is how someone would turn the
# protection off, so it always gets a second pair of eyes.
/.github/                           @phildonovan
/.githooks/                         @phildonovan
/scripts/hooks_guard.py             @phildonovan
/scripts/install_hooks.py           @phildonovan
/.gitignore                         @phildonovan
/.gitattributes                     @phildonovan
/CLAUDE.md                          @phildonovan
